# RECALL GAP (blind spot) — a real defect the engine CANNOT catch today. Keep this label:
# it measures the blind spot honestly (it will always score as a miss / false-negative).
{"dimension":"completeness","namespace":"public","entity":"customers","field":"client_id","severity":"medium","note":"BLIND SPOT: 3000 client_id rows hold the literal string 'null' (disguised missing). The engine sees nullCount=0, so completeness never fires. A disguised-missing detector (RECOMMENDED RULE) would be needed."}
